Khu v\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fn \u273\'3f\u7885\'3fc s\u225\'e1ch}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\rtlch\alang1081\ltrch\hich\afs24\alang1033\dbch\langfe2052\loch\fs24\lang1033\ltrpar{
Khu v\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fn \u273\'3f\u7885\'3fc s\u225\'e1ch n\u7857\'3fm sau th\u432\'3f vi\u7879\'3fn ph\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fng, n\u417\'3fi tr\u432\'3f\u7899\'3fc \u273\'3f\u226\'e2y ch\u7881\'3f c\u243\'f3 m\u7897\'3ft kho\u7843\'3fng s\u226\'e2n tr\u7889\'3fng. C\u225\'e1c c\u244\'f4 th\u7911\'3f th\u432\'3f xin h\u7841\'3ft gi\u7889\'3fng t\u7915\'3f tr\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fng ti\u7875\'3fu h\u7885\'3fc, c\u242\'f2n b\u225\'e1c th\u7907\'3f m\u7897\'3fc \u273\'3f\u243\'f3ng ba chi\u7871\'3fc gh\u7871\'3f d\u224\'e0i b\u7857\'3fng g\u7895\'3f t\u225\'e1i s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\rtlch\alang1081\ltrch\hich\afs24\alang1033\dbch\langfe2052\loch\fs24\lang1033\ltrpar{
M\u7895\'3fi s\u225\'e1ng th\u7913\'3f b\u7843\'3fy, m\u7897\'3ft nh\u243\'f3m h\u224\'e0ng x\u243\'f3m t\u432\'3f\u7899\'3fi c\u226\'e2y v\u224\'e0 \u273\'3f\u7893\'3fi s\u225\'e1ch. Tr\u7867\'3f nh\u7887\'3f ch\u7885\'3fn truy\u7879\'3fn tranh; ng\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fi l\u7899\'3fn mang \u273\'3f\u7871\'3fn s\u225\'e1ch n\u7845\'3fu \u259\'3fn, b\u7843\'3fn \u273\'3f\u7891\'3f c\u361\'3f v\u224\'e0 t\u7841\'3fp ch\u237\'ed khoa h\u7885\'3fc. Nh\u7919\'3fng quy\u7875\'3fn s\u225\'e1ch \u273\'3f\u432\'3f\u7907\'3fc b\u7885\'3fc gi\u7845\'3fy n\u226\'e2u \u273\'3f\u7875\'3f m\u432\'3fa kh\u244\'f4ng l\u224\'e0m cong g\u243\'f3c.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\ilvl1\outlinelevel1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\rtlch\alang1081\ltrch\hich\afs28\alang1033\ab\dbch\langfe2052\loch\fs28\lang1033\b{\listtext\pard\plain \tab}\ls1 \fi0\li0\lin0\fi0\li0\lin0\ltrpar{
