V\u224\'e0o ng\u224\'e0y n\u7855\'3fng, chi\u7871\'3fc b\u224\'e0n d\u432\'3f\u7899\'3fi gi\u224\'e0n hoa gi\u7845\'3fy tr\u7903\'3f th\u224\'e0nh ch\u7895\'3f h\u7885\'3fc b\u224\'e0i. Khi m\u432\'3fa \u273\'3f\u7871\'3fn, m\u7885\'3fi ng\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fi chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u224\'e0o m\u225\'e1i hi\u234\'ean m\u224\'e0 kh\u244\'f4ng c\u7847\'3fn \u273\'3f\u243\'f3ng c\u7917\'3fa khu v\u432\'3f\u7901\'3fn. M\u7897\'3ft t\u7845\'3fm b\u7843\'3fng g\u7895\'3f ghi l\u7883\'3fch ch\u259\'3fm c\u226\'e2y, nh\u432\'3fng ai \u273\'3fi ngang c\u361\'3fng c\u243\'f3 th\u7875\'3f th\u234\'eam m\u7897\'3ft d\u242\'f2ng nh\u7855\'3fc vi\u7879\'3fc.}
